{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116438",
      "title": "Redirecting Users",
      "lectureOrder": 283,
      "videoOrder": 270,
      "sourceHash": "e663a0997d862b3bfadbfcac75fd3dfb6feafd14f6a55db22b1b9b7394f5bea6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 2.61,
          "en": "So sometimes, you wanna show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "some fallback or not found component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "if a certain unsupported path was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 14.63,
          "en": "but in other cases, you might want to redirect the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.09,
          "end": 17.22,
          "en": "For example, in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 22.22,
          "en": "if the user enters localhost.4200/ nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "I am showing this text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 32.18,
          "en": "If the user enters /users/u3,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.46,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "I'm showing this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 38.31,
          "en": "but I'm not showing the tasks component fallback text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 40.86,
          "en": "which I would get if I click on a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.86,
          "end": 45.75,
          "en": "so that fallback text here if a user has no tasks yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.75,
          "end": 49.2,
          "en": "So therefore, here, for these routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.2,
          "end": 53.01,
          "en": "I actually wanna set up another child route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.01,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "where the path is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "So the path is, therefore, essentially the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 60.15,
          "en": "as for the parent route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.15,
          "end": 63.24,
          "en": "but, here, I then don't want to load some component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.24,
          "end": 66.93299999999999,
          "en": "but instead I wanna redirect the user to this child route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 70.65,
          "en": "So put in our words, the default behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.65,
          "end": 73.44,
          "en": "for this user tasks component route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.44,
          "end": 78.44,
          "en": "should be that if no other path segment is added thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.78,
          "end": 82.743,
          "en": "the user gets redirected to the tasks child route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 86.03999999999999,
          "en": "For that, we need this empty path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.03999999999999,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "but then instead of specifying a component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 93.513,
          "en": "you should specify redirectTo as a property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 97.71000000000001,
          "en": "and that then allows you to specify the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.71000000000001,
          "end": 99.813,
          "en": "to which you want to redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.37,
          "end": 106.17,
          "en": "So in my case here, to tasks, so to this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.17,
          "end": 109.14,
          "en": "however, when specifying a redirectTo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.14,
          "end": 114.06,
          "en": "you should also add the path match property to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 114.06,
          "end": 117.483,
          "en": "how this redirect path here should be parsed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 118.62,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "You can set it to either prefix or full,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "and, here, I'll set it to prefix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 123.78,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "and I'll get back to that in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 129.974,
          "en": "With that set though, you will see that if you enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 129.974,
          "end": 134.974,
          "en": "/users/u1, for example, and you hit Enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "the tasks part is added automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 140.433,
          "en": "So our redirect works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 141.9,
          "end": 145.05,
          "en": "but what's this path match thing about now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 148.07999999999998,
          "en": "and why do we set it to prefix?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 150.18,
          "en": "Well, here, it wouldn't make a difference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 150.18,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "whether you set it to prefix or full.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "In both scenarios, you can enter your path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "hit Enter, and you would be taken there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.24,
          "en": "but depending on your route configuration in other projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 162.24,
          "end": 163.98,
          "en": "it could make a difference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.98,
          "end": 167.04,
          "en": "because the difference is that with prefix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 169.68,
          "en": "Angular takes a look at this path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.68,
          "end": 173.97,
          "en": "combined with any parent route paths, if available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 177.72,
          "en": "and it checks if the URL that has been entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 181.29,
          "en": "into the browser starts with this path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.29,
          "end": 184.26,
          "en": "so this path combined with parent route paths,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 188.763,
          "en": "if the currently entered URL starts with that overall path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.32,
          "end": 192.06,
          "en": "With full, on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.06,
          "end": 195.33,
          "en": "it checks whether the entire entered path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.33,
          "end": 198.153,
          "en": "is equal to the path of this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.41,
          "end": 200.79,
          "en": "and you can see the difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.79,
          "end": 204.723,
          "en": "if you change this main root route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 208.05,
          "en": "If instead of loading a component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.05,
          "end": 213.05,
          "en": "we decide to redirect, let's say, to /users/u1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.67000000000002,
          "end": 217.86,
          "en": "if that's what we want to do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.86,
          "end": 222.363,
          "en": "and we set path match to prefix, we'll have a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 223.26,
          "end": 225,
          "en": "Because if we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 227.85,
          "en": "we have, possibly, infinite redirects here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.85,
          "end": 231.63,
          "en": "as this error tells us because every route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.63,
          "end": 235.32,
          "en": "starts with nothing or with an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 235.32,
          "end": 237.36,
          "en": "if you wanna put it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.36,
          "end": 239.55,
          "en": "and with path match prefix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.55,
          "end": 243.06,
          "en": "Angular would look at the beginning of the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.06,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "and see that every URL is met by this condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 249.81,
          "en": "Every URL starts with an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.81,
          "end": 251.88,
          "en": "if you wanna look it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 251.88,
          "end": 254.37,
          "en": "So every route would trigger this redirect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 254.37,
          "end": 255.9,
          "en": "and that would, of course, give us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.9,
          "end": 257.973,
          "en": "an infinite redirect loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.84,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "So here, we would want full instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 264.93,
          "en": "so that there must not be anything after this empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.93,
          "end": 267.42,
          "en": "for this route to become active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.42,
          "end": 270.75,
          "en": "So now, really, only your-domain/ nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 270.75,
          "end": 274.74,
          "en": "would trigger this route and this redirect therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 274.74,
          "end": 277.17,
          "en": "For now, save this, this error goes away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.17,
          "end": 279.24,
          "en": "and if we don't enter anything here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 284.07,
          "en": "we are redirected to /users/u1, and then to /tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 284.07,
          "end": 286.953,
          "en": "because of that other redirect we set up earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.39,
          "end": 290.90999999999997,
          "en": "So here, it would make a difference,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.90999999999997,
          "end": 294.06,
          "en": "but, here, I'll go back to that no task component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.06,
          "end": 298.5,
          "en": "I just wanted to show you the idea behind path match.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 300.03,
          "en": "Here, it did not matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.03,
          "end": 303.99,
          "en": "because we were dealing with a nested child route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 303.99,
          "end": 305.49,
          "en": "and that's, therefore, how you can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 305.49,
          "end": 307.443,
          "en": "set up automatic redirects.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
